# AutoTrack 🚗

A full-stack vehicle maintenance and service management web application.

## Features
- JWT-based authentication (signup, login, forgot/reset password)
- Vehicle management — add, edit, delete your cars
- Maintenance log — track service history per vehicle
- Service scheduling — book, edit, and cancel appointments
- Online shop — browse parts, add to cart, place COD orders
- Admin dashboard — manage users, orders, send email reminders

## Tech Stack
**Backend:** Java 17 · Spring Boot 3.2 · Spring Security · MongoDB Atlas · JavaMail  
**Frontend:** HTML5 · CSS3 · Vanilla JavaScript  
**Auth:** JWT (JSON Web Tokens) · BCrypt password hashing

